Subject: [PATCH 14/16] LABWORLDS.md: lab bundles and the fed-vortex evaluation
 candidate; per-group reliance in the report

Records the LabBundle format and hook, the fed vortices' behaviour under the chosen noise (splitting
continues to t~2920, same-sign daughters), ports and envelope, the rod-neck division programs, the
15-program suite's control ratios, the absence of a clean division-specific control, the groups the
evaluation should not rely on, the reference reward under rewards.py (0.726 at K=2) and the
credit-free validation. fedvortex_report.py now lists, per score group, the programs on which a naive
control stays inside that group's native band and the cases where the null leaves it.

